              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Horse, thrusting spear, light armour, sword, shield. May have warhorse (+4 pts). May exchange light armour for heavy armour (+1 pt). May exchange thrusting spear for lance (+4 pts). May have horse barding (+2 pts). Ferocious Charge. May count a Rank Bonus of up to +1 in combat. Bloodthirsty. Reconquista only. (El Cid p.13)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile id="1c5c-171f-cb08-bbb8" name="Armour Save" hidden="false" typeId="0dbe-f4ed-ef08-8e86" typeName="Armour Save">
