              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Thrusting spear, shield, javelins. May exchange thrusting spear for throwing spear (+1 pt). Any Peones unit may be declared Light Infantry prior to deployment for no extra cost. Combined Formation: may have up to 50% Arqueros in the rear ranks of the unit. Reconquista: may have light armour (+2 pts per model). (El Cid p.13)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile id="be4b-f648-88f2-5f14" name="Armour Save" hidden="false" typeId="0dbe-f4ed-ef08-8e86" typeName="Armour Save">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Save" typeId="603e-2898-6af9-6cf1">6+</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="With conditional bonuses" typeId="5882-dd5a-bc28-4024">-</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Notes" typeId="d5e4-804e-6192-0114">Armour save from armour, shield and barding bonus pips (rulebook pp.95-98); maximum 3+ (2+ for barded cavalry). M already includes encumbrance for armour/barding (p.96). Conditional pips are in the next column.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
              <modifiers>
                <!-- armour-save -->
