              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Crossbow, sword. May have shields (+1 pt) and/or light armour (+2 pts). Light Infantry. The number of units of Militia Crossbowmen may not exceed the total number of units of Peones. The Age of El Cid: only a single unit (0-1). Not available in Asturias. (El Cid p.14)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile id="3bdc-b01c-2f77-1dbb" name="Armour Save" hidden="false" typeId="0dbe-f4ed-ef08-8e86" typeName="Armour Save">
              <characteristics>
